  Slug: pilgrim
  DisplayName: Pilgrim
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: In your youth, you made several pilgrimages to important shrines and
    sacred sites. You might have been a mendicant friar, a seller of religious relics
    (real or fraudulent), or just a simple farmer following the dictates of your
    faith. Whatever the aims of your wanderings now, your faith still protects you
    on the road. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Wisdom or Charisma ,
    and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Religion skill and the
    Lore skill for your patron deity. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Pilgrim's
    Token] skill feat.
